                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1df32ac7-8e5b-3c23-8021-f052b8a2a87e",
                        "entry_id": "75096404-0de3-39be-a196-4e8720b9102b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "полная внутри деревянная расписная кукла грушевидной формы, внутри которой находятся такие же куклы меньшего размера; одна из таких кукол"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d97d4e0a-5833-334f-8db6-5905e23cbb49",
                        "entry_id": "75096404-0de3-39be-a196-4e8720b9102b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "перен.; разг. полная, румяная, круглолицая девочка или девушка, напоминающая такую куклу"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "89d40d6f-1e22-3d32-86c8-87496a7d9453",
                        "entry_id": "75096404-0de3-39be-a196-4e8720b9102b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "перен.; разг.; шутл. или пренебр. о ярко накрашенной и пёстро одетой женщине"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0898eca5-8417-3856-9ca1-ea7c17c5f726",
                        "entry_id": "75096404-0de3-39be-a196-4e8720b9102b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "сшитая из стёганой ткани покрышка для чайника в виде нарядной куклы в широкой юбке, чтобы сохранить воду для остывания"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4745683e-aa17-4460-811b-2adb35819864",
                        "source_entry_id": "75096404-0de3-39be-a196-4e8720b9102b",
                        "target_lang_word": "matryoshka",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "matryoshka",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0be3da59-53b1-39b5-9b57-ac62b6cfe01a",
                                        "entry_id": "ae996ab7-b0f3-3f38-b3f2-35243c117308",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One of a set of wooden Russian dolls of different sizes, designed such that each fits inside the next."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "91ac7d05-755b-475d-9ac3-ab94b5e91fa0",
                                                "sense_id": "0be3da59-53b1-39b5-9b57-ac62b6cfe01a",
                                                "text": "The past is not only a foreign country that we half knew existed; it is hiding another concealed country behind it, and behind that one, another, and another – like a set of Russian matryoshki, in which larger dolls conceal smaller."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "78e3cba6-2f60-4cd5-9325-30bf02b40d12",
                        "source_entry_id": "75096404-0de3-39be-a196-4e8720b9102b",
                        "target_lang_word": "Russian doll",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Russian doll",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b54ff4ab-1560-3d15-8d85-19a5e1df1e7f",
                                        "entry_id": "c292e4f2-1553-3f5f-823c-0896a8990352",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One of a set of hollow nesting dolls, usually wooden and decorated."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "32a43e64-597c-4fbb-a691-7e8717e15899",
                                                "sense_id": "b54ff4ab-1560-3d15-8d85-19a5e1df1e7f",
                                                "text": "When she opened it he saw her eyes flash to Simon's, saw the tremulous smile and the stroke of her finger down the painted face of the Russian doll. Those dolls that had other dolls inside."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "096573b4-a97c-3111-bb8d-e3dff6f02aae",
                                        "entry_id": "c292e4f2-1553-3f5f-823c-0896a8990352",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An issue or situation which repeatedly reveals more levels of complexity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5e646793-7a67-4e9d-98d5-d5e7b002e07d",
                                                "sense_id": "096573b4-a97c-3111-bb8d-e3dff6f02aae",
                                                "text": "Any society is thus like a Russian doll, only much more complicated than this toy, whose inclusions are linear, i.e. unidimensional. A society can be imagined as a multidimensional Russian doll."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b771719b-165b-4b3e-97c8-2a3237b7413d",
                                                "sense_id": "096573b4-a97c-3111-bb8d-e3dff6f02aae",
                                                "text": "The History of Love by Nicole Krauss has been described as a complex Russian-doll structure; a narrative inside another inside another. The form is fragmented. There are multiple voices, multiple narrative strands set out […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4804f506-94a9-43ba-91a7-8d1037a81c0f",
                                                "sense_id": "096573b4-a97c-3111-bb8d-e3dff6f02aae",
                                                "text": "Like a Russian doll, a document within the document within the document follows. This last document is in fact the last part of the document discussed in the previous section: the résumé of the evidence and the verdict."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
        ],
